function renderPairs(){const p=active(),results=new Map((p?.journeyResults||[]).map(j=>[j.journeyId,j])),newly=new Set(p?.newlyConnectedJourneyIds||[]),d=state.data;const destinations=d.nodes.filter(n=>n.kind==='destination');if(destinations.length<=35&&d.id==='city'&&!pairFilter){let html='<span></span>'+destinations.map(n=>`<span class="axis">${esc(n.label)}</span>`).join('');for(let i=0;i<destinations.length;i++){html+=`<span class="axis">${esc(destinations[i].label)}</span>`;for(let k=0;k<destinations.length;k++){if(k<=i){html+='<span class="cell empty" aria-hidden="true"></span>';continue;}const j=d.journeys.find(j=>(j.origin===destinations[i].id&&j.destination===destinations[k].id)||(j.destination===destinations[i].id&&j.origin===destinations[k].id));if(!j){html+='<span></span>';continue;}const ok=results.get(j.id)?.reachable;html+=`<button class="cell ${ok?'connected':''} ${newly.has(j.id)?'new':''}" data-pair="${esc(j.id)}" aria-label="${esc(j.label)}: ${ok?'connected':'disconnected'}">${ok?'✓':'×'}</button>`;}}$('pairs').innerHTML=`<div class="matrix" style="grid-template-columns:20px repeat(${destinations.length},1fr)">${html}</div>`;}else {const filtered=d.journeys.filter(j=>(j.label||j.id).toLowerCase().includes(pairFilter.toLowerCase())),pages=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(filtered.length/60));pairPage=Math.min(pairPage,pages-1);$('pairs').innerHTML=`<p class="hint">${filtered.length} matching pairs · page ${pairPage+1}/${pages}. Select a pair to inspect it.</p><div class="journey-list">${filtered.slice(pairPage*60,(pairPage+1)*60).map(j=>`<button class="${results.get(j.id)?.reachable?'connected':''}" data-pair="${esc(j.id)}">${results.get(j.id)?.reachable?'✓':'×'} ${esc(j.label)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="inline-actions"><button id="pairs-prev" ${pairPage===0?'disabled':''}>Previous pairs</button><button id="pairs-next" ${pairPage===pages-1?'disabled':''}>Next pairs</button></div>`;$('pairs-prev').onclick=()=>{pairPage--;renderPairs();};$('pairs-next').onclick=()=>{pairPage++;renderPairs();};};for(const el of $('pairs').querySelectorAll('[data-pair]'))el.onclick=()=>selectPair(el.dataset.pair);}
function renderRoute(){if(!state.selection){$('route-details').innerHTML='<p class="message">Choose a destination pair to inspect its route. No blue route is selected by default.</p>';return;}const p=active(),j=p?.journeyResults.find(j=>j.journeyId===state.selection);$('route-details').innerHTML=j?.reachable?`<h3>${j.distanceMeters} m</h3><p class="hint">Compatible with recorded criteria in this view.</p><p>${j.nodeIds.map(id=>state.data.nodes.find(n=>n.id===id)).filter(n=>n.label).map(n=>esc(n.label)).join(' → ')}</p><p class="hint">${state.data.source?'Lengths derived from mapped geometry.':'Illustrative distances.'}</p>`:'<p class="message">No compatible connection in this view. Unknown paths are excluded.</p>';}
function renderEvidence(){const d=state.data,unknown=d.paths.filter(p=>p.fixedCompatibility==='unknown').length,blocked=d.paths.filter(p=>p.fixedCompatibility==='incompatible').length,known=d.paths.length-unknown-blocked,percent=d.paths.length?100*unknown/d.paths.length:0;$('coverage').innerHTML=`<h3 class="section-title">${percent.toFixed(1)}% of edges have unknown compatibility</h3><p class="hint">${unknown} unknown · ${blocked} incompatible · ${known} compatible with recorded criteria. ${d.isHypothetical?'Compatibility assumptions are hypothetical, not OSM evidence.':''}</p><div class="coverage-bars"><span style="width:${100*known/d.paths.length}%;background:#51d3d2"></span><span style="width:${100*blocked/d.paths.length}%;background:#ff7b88"></span><span style="width:${percent}%;background:#e9ba65"></span></div>`;$('evidence-list').innerHTML=`<table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Record</th><th>Provenance</th><th>Condition</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody>${d.paths.slice(0,100).map(p=>`<tr><td>${esc(p.id)}</td><td>${badge(p.provenance)}<br>${p.compatibilityProvenance!==p.provenance?badge(p.compatibilityProvenance):''}</td><td>${esc(p.fixedCompatibility)}</td><td>${esc(p.evidenceNote||'No field observation')} ${p.osmWayIds?.length?`<a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/${Number(p.osmWayIds[0])}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OSM way</a>`:''}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table><p class="hint">Showing ${Math.min(100,d.paths.length)} of ${d.paths.length} edge records. All records remain in calculations.</p>`;}
function persist(){try{localStorage.setItem('disabledaccess-v4-edits',JSON.stringify(areas.map(d=>({id:d.id,barriers:d.barriers,repairs:d.repairs}))));}catch{notify('Storage unavailable; changes last for this session.');}}
function switchTab(name){for(const el of document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]')){el.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(el.dataset.tab===name));el.tabIndex=el.dataset.tab===name?0:-1;}for(const el of document.querySelectorAll('.analysis-pane'))el.hidden=el.id!=='pane-'+name;}
function rendererMode(mode){if(mode==='geo'&&!state.data.source){notify('This synthetic fixture has no geographic coordinates.');return;}renderer=mode;$('geo-map').hidden=mode!=='geo';$('svg-map').hidden=mode==='geo';if(mode==='geo')renderGeo();render();}
function geoFeatures(){const p=active(),d=state.data;return{type:'FeatureCollection',features:M.presentation(d,p,state.selection).filter(f=>f.geo).map(f=>({type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'LineString',coordinates:f.geo},properties:{id:f.id,status:f.status,selected:f.selected,barrier:f.path.barrierIds[0]||''}}))};}
function fallbackMap(reason){clearTimeout(geoTimer);renderer='svg';$('geo-map').hidden=true;$('svg-map').hidden=false;if(geoMap){geoMap.remove();geoMap=null;}geoReady=false;geoArea=null;notify(reason+' Offline schematic remains available.');render();}
function renderGeo(fit=false){if(!state.data.source||renderer!=='geo')return;if(offlineMode||!navigator.onLine){fallbackMap('Network unavailable.');return;}if(!window.maplibregl){fallbackMap('Geographic library unavailable.');return;}if(!geoMap){tilesErrors=0;try{geoMap=new maplibregl.Map({container:'geo-map',style:window.DABasemapStyle||'https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/liberty',center:[77.219,28.630],zoom:16,attributionControl:true,pitch:0});geoMap.addControl(new maplibregl.NavigationControl(),'bottom-right');geoMap.on('click',captureCorner);geoTimer=setTimeout(()=>{if(!geoReady)fallbackMap('Basemap did not load.');},10000);geoMap.on('error',()=>{tilesErrors++;if(tilesErrors>=3)fallbackMap('Basemap request failed.');});geoMap.on('style.load',()=>{clearTimeout(geoTimer);geoReady=true;geoMap.addSource('da-network',{type:'geojson',data:geoFeatures()});geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-lines',type:'line',source:'da-network',paint:{'line-color':['match',['get','status'],'unknown',colors.unknown,'blocked',colors.blocked,'repair',colors.repair,colors.usable],'line-width':['case',['get','selected'],6,3],'line-opacity':.9,'line-dasharray':[1,0]}});for(const status of ['unknown','blocked'])geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-'+status,type:'line',source:'da-network',filter:['==',['get','status'],status],paint:{'line-color':colors[status],'line-width':4,'line-dasharray':status==='unknown'?[1,3]:[3,2]}});geoMap.setFilter('da-lines',['!', ['in',['get','status'],['literal',['unknown','blocked']]]]);geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-halo',type:'line',source:'da-network',filter:['==',['get','status'],'repair'],paint:{'line-color':colors.repair,'line-width':13,'line-opacity':.25}});geoMap.addSource('da-markers',{type:'geojson',data:geoMarkers()});geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-markers',type:'circle',source:'da-markers',paint:{'circle-radius':8,'circle-color':['case',['get','resolved'],colors.repair,colors.blocked],'circle-stroke-color':'#132235','circle-stroke-width':2}});if(geoMap.getStyle().glyphs)geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-mark-label',type:'symbol',source:'da-markers',layout:{'text-field':['case',['get','resolved'],'✓','×'],'text-size':14,'text-allow-overlap':true},paint:{'text-color':'#132235'}});geoMap.on('click','da-markers',e=>inspectBarrier(e.features[0].properties.id));geoMap.addSource('da-flood',{type:'geojson',data:geoFlood()});geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-flood',type:'line',source:'da-flood',paint:{'line-color':'#51d3d2','line-width':9,'line-opacity':.7}});geoMap.addSource('da-critical',{type:'geojson',data:geoCritical()});geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-critical',type:'line',source:'da-critical',paint:{'line-color':'#ffb45e','line-width':7,'line-dasharray':[1,2]}});geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-route',type:'line',source:'da-network',filter:['==',['get','selected'],true],paint:{'line-color':'#78aaff','line-width':6}});for(const layer of ['da-lines','da-unknown','da-blocked'])geoMap.on('click',layer,e=>{if(drawPoints)return;const f=e.features?.[0];if(f)inspectPath(f.properties.id);});geoMap.addSource('da-nodes',{type:'geojson',data:geoNodes()});geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-nodes',type:'circle',source:'da-nodes',paint:{'circle-radius':['case',['get','destination'],6,3],'circle-color':'#152c40','circle-stroke-width':1.5,'circle-stroke-color':'#b1dbea'}});geoMap.moveLayer('da-markers');if(geoMap.getLayer('da-mark-label'))geoMap.moveLayer('da-mark-label');geoMap.on('click','da-nodes',e=>{if(!drawPoints)inspectPoint(e.features[0].properties.id);});renderGeo(true);});}catch{fallbackMap('WebGL map is unavailable.');}return;}if(!geoReady)return;geoMap.getSource('da-network')?.setData(geoFeatures());geoMap.getSource('da-markers')?.setData(geoMarkers());geoMap.getSource('da-flood')?.setData(geoFlood());geoMap.getSource('da-nodes')?.setData(geoNodes());geoMap.getSource('da-critical')?.setData(geoCritical());geoMap.resize();if(fit||geoArea!==state.data.id){const coords=state.data.nodes.filter(n=>Number.isFinite(n.lon)&&Number.isFinite(n.lat));if(coords.length){const bounds=new maplibregl.LngLatBounds();coords.forEach(n=>bounds.extend([n.lon,n.lat]));geoMap.fitBounds(bounds,{padding:window.innerWidth<900?35:{top:110,bottom:45,left:300,right:325},duration:0,maxZoom:18});}geoArea=state.data.id;}}
function sliceLine(points,start,end){const coords=points.map(p=>Array.isArray(p)?p:[p.x,p.y]),lengths=[0];for(let i=1;i<coords.length;i++)lengths.push(lengths.at(-1)+Math.hypot(coords[i][0]-coords[i-1][0],coords[i][1]-coords[i-1][1]));const total=lengths.at(-1);function at(f){const target=f*total;let i=1;while(i<lengths.length-1&&lengths[i]<target)i++;const t=(target-lengths[i-1])/(lengths[i]-lengths[i-1]||1);return coords[i-1].map((v,k)=>v+(coords[i][k]-v)*t);}const out=[at(start),...coords.filter((p,i)=>lengths[i]>start*total&&lengths[i]<end*total),at(end)];return Array.isArray(points[0])?out:out.map(([x,y])=>({x,y}));}
function geoNodes(){return{type:'FeatureCollection',features:state.data.nodes.filter(n=>Number.isFinite(n.lon)&&Number.isFinite(n.lat)).map(n=>({type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'Point',coordinates:[n.lon,n.lat]},properties:{id:n.id,destination:n.kind==='destination'}}))};}
function geoFlood(){return{type:'FeatureCollection',features:reachLines(state.reach?.[state.reach.show]).filter(l=>l.geo).map(l=>({type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'LineString',coordinates:l.geo},properties:{}}))};}
function geoCritical(){return{type:'FeatureCollection',features:(state.fragility?.bridges||[]).filter(b=>b.lostPairs.length).map(b=>({type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'LineString',coordinates:M.geoGeometry(state.data,state.data.paths.find(p=>p.id===b.pathId))},properties:{}}))};}
function geoMarkers(){const p=active(),d=state.data,resolved=new Set([...d.barriers.filter(b=>b.status==='resolved').map(b=>b.id),...d.repairs.filter(r=>p?.repairIds.includes(r.id)).flatMap(r=>r.resolvesBarrierIds)]);return{type:'FeatureCollection',features:d.barriers.flatMap(b=>{const path=d.paths.find(p=>p.barrierIds.includes(b.id)),node=d.nodes.find(n=>n.id===b.nodeId),line=path&&M.geoGeometry(d,path);if(!line)return[];return[{type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'Point',coordinates:node?[node.lon,node.lat]:sliceLine(line,0,.5).at(-1)},properties:{id:b.id,resolved:resolved.has(b.id)}}];})};}
let importController=null;
function boxInputs(){return['bbox-w','bbox-s','bbox-e','bbox-n'].map(id=>Number($(id).value));}
$('pair-search').oninput=e=>{pairFilter=e.target.value;pairPage=0;renderPairs();};
function renderPOIs(){const d=state.data;if(!d.imported){$('poi-results').innerHTML='<p class="hint">Load recorded evidence to select mapped destinations.</p>';return;}const q=$('poi-search').value.toLowerCase(),selected=new Set(d.nodes.filter(n=>n.kind==='destination').map(n=>n.id)),items=[...d.nodes.map(n=>({id:n.id,label:n.label,linked:true})),...(d.pois||[]).filter(p=>!p.linked)].filter(p=>(p.label+' '+p.id).toLowerCase().includes(q));$('poi-results').innerHTML=`<p class="hint">${selected.size}/60 destinations · ${d.journeys.length} pairs. Showing ${Math.min(30,items.length)} of ${items.length} matching points. Unlinked POIs are never snapped across streets.</p><div class="journey-list">${items.slice(0,30).map(p=>`<button data-dest="${esc(p.id)}" ${!p.linked?'disabled':''} aria-pressed="${selected.has(p.id)}">${selected.has(p.id)?'✓ ':''}${esc(p.label)} ${!p.linked?'(not linked)':''}</button>`).join('')}</div>`;for(const el of $('poi-results').querySelectorAll('[data-dest]'))el.onclick=()=>toggleDestination(el.dataset.dest);}
function toggleDestination(id){if(!state.data.imported)return;const ids=state.data.nodes.filter(n=>n.kind==='destination').map(n=>n.id);try{DAImporter.destinations(state.data,ids.includes(id)?ids.filter(x=>x!==id):[...ids,id]);loadArea(state.data.id);}catch(e){notify(e.message);}}
let importCooldown=0;
async function fetchArea(){if(importController){importController.abort();return;}let box;try{box=boxInputs();DAImporter.bounds(box);}catch(e){notify(e.message);return;}if(Date.now()<importCooldown){notify('Please wait 30 seconds after the previous server error before retrying.');return;}const revision=state.revision;importController=new AbortController();$('fetch-area').textContent='Cancel import';const key=box.join(',');$('import-status').textContent='Checking local cache…';try{let raw,retrieved,cacheHit=false;try{const cached=await DACache.get(key);raw=cached?.raw;retrieved=cached?.retrieved;cacheHit=!!raw;}catch{}if(importController.signal.aborted)throw new Error('Import cancelled.');if(!raw){if(offlineMode||!navigator.onLine)throw new Error('Offline: no cached data for this rectangle.');$('fetch-area').textContent='Cancel import';$('import-status').textContent='Requesting public Overpass data. This may take up to 30 seconds.';const[w,s,e,n]=box,bbox=[s,w,n,e].join(','),query=`[out:json][timeout:25];(way[highway~"^(footway|path|pedestrian|crossing|steps|living_street|residential|service)$"](${bbox});node[amenity](${bbox});node[public_transport](${bbox}););(._;>;);out body qt;`,timer=setTimeout(()=>importController?.abort(),30000);try{const response=await fetch($('overpass-server').value,{method:'POST',body:new URLSearchParams({data:query}),signal:importController.signal});if(!response.ok){importCooldown=Date.now()+30000;throw new Error('Overpass returned HTTP '+response.status);}raw=await response.json();if(raw.remark)throw new Error('Overpass returned incomplete data: '+raw.remark);retrieved=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10);}finally{clearTimeout(timer);}try{await DACache.put(key,{raw,retrieved});}catch{notify('Local cache unavailable; evidence still loads for this session.');}}
const data=await client.request('import',raw,box,{retrieved});if(revision!==state.revision||importController.signal.aborted)throw new Error('Import cancelled because the area changed.');const old=areas.findIndex(d=>d.id===data.id);if(old>=0)areas[old]=data;else areas.push(data);areaOptions();loadArea(data.id);$('import-status').textContent=`${cacheHit?'Cached':'Imported'} ${data.nodes.length} nodes / ${data.paths.length} segments. Choose at least two destinations below or click graph points on the schematic.`;switchTab('import');}catch(e){$('import-status').textContent=(e.name==='AbortError'?'Import cancelled or timed out.':e.message)+ ' Use bundled Delhi evidence; current area is unchanged.';}finally{importController=null;$('fetch-area').textContent='Fetch OSM evidence';}}
$('fetch-area').onclick=fetchArea;$('poi-search').oninput=renderPOIs;$('use-bundled').onclick=()=>{loadArea('delhi-recorded');$('import-status').textContent='Bundled recorded OSM evidence loaded offline. Costs and proposed interventions are hypothetical.';};
$('draw-area').onclick=()=>{if(!state.data.source){notify('Load a geographic dataset first, or enter the four coordinates.');return;}rendererMode('geo');drawPoints=[];notify('Click two opposite corners on the geographic map. Keyboard alternative: edit the four coordinate fields.');$('pane-import').scrollIntoView({block:'end'});document.querySelector('.stage').scrollIntoView();};
function captureCorner(e){if(!drawPoints)return;drawPoints.push([e.lngLat.lng,e.lngLat.lat]);if(drawPoints.length===1){notify('First corner recorded. Click the opposite corner.');return;}const[a,b]=drawPoints;drawPoints=null;const box=[Math.min(a[0],b[0]),Math.min(a[1],b[1]),Math.max(a[0],b[0]),Math.max(a[1],b[1])];try{DAImporter.bounds(box);['bbox-w','bbox-s','bbox-e','bbox-n'].forEach((id,i)=>$(id).value=box[i].toFixed(6));const polygon={type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'Polygon',coordinates:[[[box[0],box[1]],[box[2],box[1]],[box[2],box[3]],[box[0],box[3]],[box[0],box[1]]]]},properties:{}};if(!geoMap.getSource('da-box')){geoMap.addSource('da-box',{type:'geojson',data:polygon});geoMap.addLayer({id:'da-box',type:'fill',source:'da-box',paint:{'fill-color':'#51d3d2','fill-opacity':.18}});}else geoMap.getSource('da-box').setData(polygon);notify('Rectangle recorded. Review the coordinates and fetch the evidence.');switchTab('import');$('pane-import').scrollIntoView();}catch(error){notify(error.message);}}
$('offline-mode').onclick=()=>{offlineMode=!offlineMode;$('offline-mode').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(offlineMode));if(offlineMode){importController?.abort();fallbackMap('Offline rehearsal enabled.');}else notify('Online map and import requests enabled.');};

const creditColors=['#b9f36b','#51d3d2','#e9ba65','#b6a1f3','#ff99b0','#9fc5f3','#e3caad','#a1c9a6','#e5ade9','#b9d7e8'];
function renderAnalysis(){renderCredit();renderFrontier();renderReach();renderFragility();}
function renderCredit(){const a=state.analysis;$('credit-content').innerHTML='<h3 class="section-title">Who gets credit when repairs work together?</h3><p class="hint">Exact Shapley attribution among repairs in the recommended plan; every coalition is evaluated. Fractional values are shares of newly connected pairs, not people.</p><button id="calculate-credit" '+(!state.plan?'disabled':'')+'>Calculate repair credit</button>';if(a){$('credit-content').innerHTML+=`<div class="shapley-stack">${a.rows.map((r,i)=>`<span style="width:${a.total?100*r.value/a.total:0}%;background:${creditColors[i]}" title="${esc(r.id)}: ${r.value.toFixed(3)}">${r.value>0?esc(r.id):''}</span>`).join('')}</div><p>${a.rows.reduce((s,r)=>s+r.value,0).toFixed(2)} credited shares = ${a.total} destination pairs newly connected.</p><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Repair</th><th>Share</th><th>Actual counterfactual</th></tr></thead><tbody>${a.rows.map(r=>{const repair=state.data.repairs.find(x=>x.id===r.id),example=state.data.journeys.find(j=>j.id===r.lostPairs[0]);return`<tr><td>${esc(repair.title)} ${badge(repair.provenance)}</td><td>${r.value.toFixed(3)}</td><td>Removing ${esc(r.id)} disconnects ${r.lostPairs.length} newly connected pairs${example?', including '+esc(example.label):''}.</td></tr>`;}).join('')}</tbody></table>${creditFlow(a)}`;}$('calculate-credit').onclick=()=>request('attribution',[state.plan.recommended.repairIds],value=>state.analysis=value);}
function creditFlow(a){const pairs=[...new Set(a.rows.flatMap(r=>Object.keys(r.pairs)))].slice(0,12),height=Math.max(140,pairs.length*24),right=new Map(pairs.map((id,i)=>[id,i*24+20]));return`<h3>Repair → destination-pair credit</h3><p class="hint">Showing ${pairs.length} of ${a.total} newly connected pairs, in dataset order. Line thickness represents that repair’s fractional credit for the pair. The table above uses every pair.</p><svg class="pair-flow" viewBox="0 0 900 ${height+20}" role="img" aria-label="Repair to pair credit flow">${a.rows.map((r,i)=>{const y=20+i*(height-20)/Math.max(1,a.rows.length-1);return`<text x="5" y="${y+4}">${esc(r.id)}</text>`+pairs.filter(id=>r.pairs[id]>0).map(id=>`<path d="M 110 ${y} C 320 ${y}, 420 ${right.get(id)}, 620 ${right.get(id)}" fill="none" stroke="${creditColors[i]}" stroke-width="${1+4*r.pairs[id]}" opacity=".65"><title>${esc(r.id)} → ${esc(id)}: ${r.pairs[id].toFixed(3)}</title></path>`).join('');}).join('')}${pairs.map(id=>`<text x="640" y="${right.get(id)+4}">${esc(state.data.journeys.find(j=>j.id===id)?.label||id)}</text>`).join('')}</svg>`;}
function renderFrontier(){const a=state.plan;if(!a){$('frontier-content').innerHTML='<p class="hint">Find a repair plan to explore its trade-offs.</p>';return;}const points=a.frontier,maxX=Math.max(...points.map(p=>p.cost),state.manual?.totalCost||0,1),maxY=Math.max(...points.map(p=>p.gain),1),x=c=>65+720*c/maxX,y=g=>260-210*g/maxY,manual=state.manual,knee=a.knee,dominated=manual&&points.some(p=>p.cost<=manual.totalCost&&p.gain>=manual.newlyConnectedJourneyIds.length&&(p.cost<manual.totalCost||p.gain>manual.newlyConnectedJourneyIds.length));$('frontier-content').innerHTML=`<h3 class="section-title">What does the next connection cost?</h3><p class="hint">${a.frontierComplete?'Complete cost/gain frontier':'Frontier of evaluated plans only; larger search was bounded'}, across 0–${state.limit} repairs and all costs${a.frontierComplete?' (including over the current money limit)':''}. The knee is a normalized gain-minus-cost heuristic, not a funding recommendation.</p><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 900 310" role="group" aria-label="Pareto frontier: cost versus newly connected destination pairs"><path d="M 65 40 V 260 H 805" fill="none" stroke="#58738b"/><text x="65" y="22">Newly connected destination pairs</text><text x="620" y="300">Illustrative cost (₹)</text><text x="14" y="${y(maxY)+4}">${maxY}</text><text x="40" y="263">0</text><text x="65" y="283">0</text><text x="750" y="283">${maxX}</text><polyline points="${points.map(p=>x(p.cost)+','+y(p.gain)).join(' ')}" fill="none" stroke="#51d3d2"/>${points.map((p,i)=>`<circle class="point" data-frontier="${i}" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Load plan: ${p.gain} pairs, ${money(p.cost)}, ${p.repairIds.length} repairs" cx="${x(p.cost)}" cy="${y(p.gain)}" r="${p===knee||p.cost===knee?.cost?8:5}"><title>${p.gain} pairs / ${money(p.cost)}</title></circle>`).join('')}${knee?`<text x="${x(knee.cost)+12}" y="${y(knee.gain)-12}">Knee</text>`:''}${manual?`<path d="M ${x(manual.totalCost)-5} ${y(manual.newlyConnectedJourneyIds.length)-5} l 10 10 m 0 -10 l -10 10" stroke="#ff99b0" stroke-width="3"><title>Your plan</title></path>`:''}<rect x="${x(a.recommended.totalCost)-9}" y="${y(a.recommended.newlyConnectedJourneyIds.length)-9}" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="#b9f36b" stroke-width="2"><title>Recommendation</title></rect></svg><p class="hint">□ Recommendation · × Your plan${dominated?' — dominated: another evaluated plan gives at least as many pairs for no more money.':'.'} Click a point or a button to load that plan. Money limit will increase if needed.</p><div class="inline-actions">${points.map((p,i)=>`<button data-frontier="${i}">${money(p.cost)} → +${p.gain} (${p.repairIds.length} repairs)</button>`).join('')}</div>`;for(const el of $('frontier-content').querySelectorAll('[data-frontier]'))bindClickKey(el,()=>loadFrontier(Number(el.dataset.frontier)));}
async function loadFrontier(index){const p=state.plan.frontier[index];if(state.useMoney&&Number($('money-budget').value)<p.cost){$('money-budget').value=p.cost;state.money=p.cost;state.plan=null;state.analysis=null;notify('Money limit raised to fit this plan. Recalculate for a recommendation under the new limit.');}cancel();state.manualIds=p.repairIds.slice();state.view='manual';state.reach=null;state.fragility=null;await request('evaluate',[p.repairIds],r=>state.manual=r);}
async function calculateReach(){const origin=$('reach-origin').value,distance=Number($('reach-distance').value),plan=active();if(!origin||!Number.isFinite(distance)||distance<0||distance>10000){notify('Choose an origin and a distance between 0 and 10,000 metres.');return;}const revision=state.revision,view=state.view,ids=plan?.repairIds||[];setBusy(true);try{const[before,after]=await Promise.all([client.request('isochrone',state.data,[],origin,distance),client.request('isochrone',state.data,ids,origin,distance)]);if(revision!==state.revision||view!==state.view)return;state.reach={before,after,view,show:'after'};render();}catch(e){if(e.message!=='Cancelled')notify(e.message);}finally{if(revision===state.revision)setBusy(false);}}
function geoSlice(path,start,end){const line=turf.lineString(M.geoGeometry(state.data,path)),length=turf.length(line,{units:'meters'});return turf.lineSliceAlong(line,start*length,end*length,{units:'meters'}).geometry.coordinates;}
function reachLines(result){if(!result)return[];return result.segments.flatMap(s=>{const path=state.data.paths.find(p=>p.id===s.pathId),ranges=s.fromFraction+s.toFraction>=1?[[0,1]]:[...(s.fromFraction>0?[[0,s.fromFraction]]:[]),...(s.toFraction>0?[[1-s.toFraction,1]]:[])];return ranges.map(([start,end])=>({path,points:sliceLine(drawPolyline(path),start,end),geo:state.data.source?geoSlice(path,start,end):null,distance:s.distance}));});}
function reachSchematic(result){const lines=reachLines(result);return`<svg viewBox="30 15 780 510" aria-label="Reachable network within ${result.maxDistance} metres" role="img">${state.data.paths.map(p=>`<polyline points="${drawPolyline(p).map(n=>n.x+','+n.y).join(' ')}" fill="none" stroke="#40515f" stroke-width="2"/>`).join('')}${lines.map(l=>`<polyline points="${l.points.map(n=>n.x+','+n.y).join(' ')}" fill="none" stroke="#51d3d2" stroke-width="6" opacity="${.4+.6*(1-Math.min(l.distance/result.maxDistance,1)||0)}"/>`).join('')}</svg>`;}
function renderReach(){const r=state.reach;$('reach-content').innerHTML=r?`<p>${r.after.maxDistance} m network distance from ${esc(state.data.nodes.find(n=>n.id===r.after.origin)?.label)}. ${r.before.nodeIds.length} → ${r.after.nodeIds.length} graph nodes reached. This is a distance flood on recorded-compatible edges, not a safety guarantee or walking-time estimate.</p><div class="two-col reach-compare"><div><h3>Current conditions</h3>${reachSchematic(r.before)}</div><div><h3>${esc(r.view)} plan</h3>${reachSchematic(r.after)}</div></div><button id="reach-before">Show current flood on main map</button> <button id="reach-after">Show plan flood on main map</button>`:'<p class="hint">Compare current conditions with the active plan. Partial edge reach is included.</p>';if(r){$('reach-before').onclick=()=>{r.show='before';renderMap();};$('reach-after').onclick=()=>{r.show='after';renderMap();};}}
function renderFragility(){const f=state.fragility;$('fragility-content').innerHTML=f?`<p>${f.bridges.length} graph bridges · ${f.articulationNodeIds.length} articulation points. Orange dashed overlay: bridges whose loss disconnects selected destination pairs.</p><p class="hint">${esc(f.scope)} Numbers below describe removal of one usable path at a time.</p><div class="two-col"><div><h3>Bridge loss</h3><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Path / provenance</th><th>Pairs disconnected</th></tr></thead><tbody>${f.bridges.slice(0,20).map(r=>`<tr><td>${esc(r.pathId)} ${badge(state.data.paths.find(p=>p.id===r.pathId).provenance)}</td><td>${r.lostPairs.length}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td>No bridges in this view.</td><td>0</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><div><h3>Edge betweenness</h3><p class="hint">All-node weighted shortest-path credit, unnormalized. Not measured traffic.</p><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Path</th><th>Score</th></tr></thead><tbody>${f.edgeBetweenness.slice(0,20).map(r=>`<tr><td>${esc(r.pathId)}</td><td>${r.value.toFixed(2)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></div><p class="hint">Showing at most 20 rows per ranking.</p>`:'<p class="hint">Run analysis on Current, Recommended or Your plan. Changing the view clears the previous result.</p>';}
$('calculate-reach').onclick=calculateReach;$('clear-reach').onclick=()=>{state.reach=null;render();};$('calculate-fragility').onclick=()=>{if(state.data.nodes.length>1000){notify('Exact all-node criticality is capped at 1,000 graph nodes. Import a smaller area.');return;}const view=state.view;request('fragility',[active()?.repairIds||[]],r=>{if(state.view===view)state.fragility=r;});};

$('area').onchange=e=>loadArea(e.target.value);$('calculate').onclick=calculate;$('cancel').onclick=cancel;$('repair-limit').oninput=e=>{state.limit=Number(e.target.value);$('limit-value').value=state.limit;invalidate();};$('money-budget').onchange=()=>{state.money=Number($('money-budget').value);invalidate();};$('use-budget').onchange=()=>{state.useMoney=$('use-budget').checked;invalidate();};$('reset-plan').onclick=()=>{state.selection=null;invalidate();};$('restore-data').onclick=()=>{const fresh=originalAreas.find(d=>d.id===state.data.id);if(!fresh){notify('Reload the imported evidence to restore it.');return;}areas[areas.findIndex(d=>d.id===fresh.id)]=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(fresh));persist();loadArea(fresh.id);};for(const view of ['current','recommended','manual'])$('view-'+view).onclick=()=>setView(view);$('renderer-svg').onclick=()=>rendererMode('svg');$('renderer-geo').onclick=()=>rendererMode('geo');$('journey').onchange=e=>selectPair(e.target.value);$('clear-route').onclick=()=>selectPair(null);$('clear-manual').onclick=()=>{cancel();state.manualIds=[];state.manual=state.baseline;state.view='manual';state.reach=null;state.fragility=null;render();};$('toggle-inspector').onclick=()=>{const hidden=$('inspector').classList.toggle('hidden');$('toggle-inspector').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!hidden));};$('close-inspector').onclick=()=>{$('inspector').classList.add('hidden');$('toggle-inspector').setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');};const tabs=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]')];for(const [i,el] of tabs.entries()){el.tabIndex=i===0?0:-1;el.setAttribute('aria-controls','pane-'+el.dataset.tab);el.onclick=()=>switchTab(el.dataset.tab);el.onkeydown=e=>{const next=e.key==='ArrowRight'?(i+1)%tabs.length:e.key==='ArrowLeft'?(i-1+tabs.length)%tabs.length:e.key==='Home'?0:e.key==='End'?tabs.length-1:null;if(next!==null){e.preventDefault();switchTab(tabs[next].dataset.tab);tabs[next].focus();}};}$('import-open').onclick=()=>{switchTab('import');$('pane-import').scrollIntoView({behavior:'auto'});};window.addEventListener('offline',()=>{if(renderer==='geo')fallbackMap('Network disconnected.');});
try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('disabledaccess-v4-edits')||'[]');for(const entry of saved){const d=areas.find(d=>d.id===entry.id);if(d){const copy={...d,barriers:entry.barriers,repairs:entry.repairs};try{DisabledAccessEngine.validate(copy);I.recordProvenance(copy);d.barriers=copy.barriers;d.repairs=copy.repairs;}catch{}}}}catch{}
try{client=new DAPlannerClient(progress);areaOptions();loadArea('city');}catch(error){notify('Launch with OPEN-PROTOTYPE.cmd to enable the local calculation worker.');$('calculate').disabled=true;}
